        "date": "2026-11-27T18:17:52Z"
      },
      "message": "docs(examples): add the 3D rest machining catalog case\n\nThe case 3d/rest roughs a plate with two ribs with a 12 mm 3D Pocket.\nA 6 mm 3D Pocket after it cuts only the 8 mm channel between the ribs\nand its two mouths, which the 12 mm tool cannot reach. The test\ncatalog_3d_rest::the_small_tool_cuts_only_the_rest_region pins this on\nthe committed program.\n\nFixes #2867\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
